type":"flow","items":["Histotechnologist","IHC Specialist","Digital Pathology / Computational Pathology"]},{"type":"p","text":"The core priority should remain excellent specimen processing and laboratory accuracy. Digital pathology and AI should then be added as differentiating skills rather than replacing the foundational histotechnology expertise."}]}]}